  "details": "Say you approach a new group of people with their avatars hidden that you want to see. You would have to go and them one at a time and that's painful especially if there's a lot of people there.\n\nThis feature would allow you to show all avatars in a selective range instead of changing individual avatars one at a time and without having to change safety settings.\n\nThe select range would be similar to the portal drop system where there would be a circle on the ground and some sort of icon to signify the action.",
